]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and May to June came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025, November to December finished at 61% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far April to May sits at 61%. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, with grid 26037 at 53%.</p>"}
